EcdsaMethodDeclarationsTest
├── when trusted parties are read
│   └── it should answer the zero address for both roles and their pending holders and an empty key list
├── when asked for the policy method interface
│   └── it should answer true
├── when asked for the erc165 interface
│   └── it should answer true
├── when asked for the invalid interface id
│   └── it should answer false
├── when asked for the pause or admin interface
│   └── it should answer false
├── when name and version are read
│   └── it should answer the same nonempty strings every time
├── when verify answers
│   └── it should return exactly one abi word
└── when any function runs
    └── it should read and write no storage
